    "title": "Put Down the White and Black Tees-Fashion People Know This Anti-Trend Color Is More Advanced - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anna LaPlaca ,\n21 hours ago\nThis fall, the most humble piece in your closet is becoming the ultimate insider move. While most people overlook this anti-trend shade in favor of a crisp white tee or trendier purple or cobalt blue, the people who actually work in fashion have moved on to something unexpected but far chicer. This fall, that's none other than the gray tee.\nGray normally reads as normcore in the best of times and boring in the worst, but the outfits I'm spotting are reconsidering the anti-fashion item as, well, quite fashion-forward. The trick is all in the styling: pairing a gray tee with something statement-making, like a printed skirt or a pair of on-trend colored jeans. It's what I'm seeing my fashion friends doing right now.\nThe neutral hue also plays nicer with color than black (no harsh contrast) and hides the wear and tear that white can't. Think no yellowing. It also happens to complement fall-friendly tones like brown and ocher especially well, so take a look at the outfit ideas below for styling inspiration and shop for a gray tee to use as the base for all your fall outfits.\n(Image credit: @monikh ) What you'll need: Gray T-shirt + printed skirt + stone necklace\nNordstrom Relaxed Fit Pima Cotton Crewneck T-Shirt\nDries Van Noten Floral-Print Silk-Satin Wrap Skirt\nHeaven Mayhem Julia Necklace\n(Image credit: @deborabrosa ) What you'll need: Gray T-shirt + trench coat + black trousers + flat sandals\nWe the Free Perfect Oversize Cotton T-Shirt\nEaves Lena Car Coat\nJ.Crew Cosmo Pant in Cupro Blend\nReformation Dolores Tassel Necklace\nA.Emery Kinto Leather Sandals\n(Image credit: Zara) What you'll need: Gray T-shirt + suede jacket + statement skirt + slingbacks\nZARA Crew Neck T-Shirt\nMassimo Dutti Suede Leather Blazer With Lapel\nCOS Embroidered Sheer Column Skirt\nReformation Calista Slingback Pump\n(Image credit: @harryarcher_ ) What you'll need: Gray T-shirt + colored jeans + pendant necklace + everyday bag\nLeset Margot Tee\nHelmut Lang Wide Leg Organic Cotton Jeans\nEliou Trout Comb Necklace\n(Image credit: @oliviasshoppingdiary ) What you'll need: Gray T-shirt + layered long-sleeve + relaxed trousers + loafers\nStill Here 2Tee Layered Cotton-Jersey T-Shirt\nCOS Relaxed Linen-Blend Wide-Leg Pants\nVince Tristan Moc Toe Loafer\nShop More Gray Tees\nFlore Flore Car Cotton Baby Tee\nFashion editors love this brand for classic T-shirts.\nJ.Crew Vintage Jersey Classic-Fit Crewneck T-Shirt\nI have this best-selling tee in white, but just added this grey tone to my cart.\nCou Cou Intimates The Raglan: Grey / Navy Cotton Jersey\nThe viral boat neck tee of the summer is back in this fall-friendly grey and navy combo.\nLioness Bloom Long Sleeve Tee\nLong-sleeve tees are having a moment, and this specific one is always selling out.\nDL1961 Shrunken V-Neck Tee\nThe baby V-neck is so forward.\nReformation Ezra Slim Fit Long Sleeve\nInto these 3/4-length sleeves.\nGap Organic Cotton Vintagesoft T-Shirt\nIt doesn't get any more classic than this—or more affordable.\nRenggli Silk Cashmere Blend Knit Tee - Pebble\nChic.\nH&M Oversized Interlock T-Shirt\nYour reminder not to overlook the men's section.\nJ.Crew New Perfect-Fit Long-Sleeve T-Shirt\nHello, fall layers.",
    "summary": "Gray normally reads as normcore in the best of times and boring in the worst, but the outfits I'm spotting are reconsidering the anti-fashion item as, well, quite fashion-forward. The neutral hue also plays nicer with color than black (no harsh contrast) and hides the wear and tear that white can't. J.Crew Vintage Jersey Classic-Fit Crewneck T-Shirt I have this best-selling tee in white, but just added this grey tone to my cart. Reformation Ezra Slim Fit Long Sleeve Gap Organic Cotton Vintagesoft T-Shirt It doesn't get any more classic than this—or more affordable.",
